   123	根因是 `frontmatter_map()` 使用 `setdefault`，只保留首个同名键值：[inbox_preview.py:546](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-v6-inbox/canvas-vault/.claude/skills/clear-inbox/scripts/inbox_preview.py:546)。URL/DOI 信号随后只扫描折叠后的 `fm.items()`。
