   359	3. [源码 1340](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-v6-inbox/canvas-vault/.claude/skills/clear-inbox/scripts/inbox_preview.py:1340)称“只收注释里有非空内容的行”，实际检查的是带分隔符的原始整行 `ln.strip()`；`<!---->` 也命中，逐字错误。
